# Calculations

`[name] := expression` defines a calculated value. Inlays show the result.

[12]:units
[$8.50]:unit_price
[subtotal] := units * unit_price
[tax] := subtotal * 8.875%
[total] := subtotal + tax

[total] for [units] units, including [tax] tax.

<!-- Try: hover total for the substituted calculation and its inputs. -->
